---
const APP_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL || 'https://app.grassion.com'
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pricing · Grassion</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free forever for small teams. Pro at $10/dev/mo (₹599 in India). Business and Enterprise for compliance and self-hosting." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/Grassion%20single%20logo%20(1).png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,200;0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --black: #0a0a0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --dim: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
      --dimmer: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    }

    html, body {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    }

    /* ── HEADER ─────────────────────────────── */
    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 52px;
      z-index: 100;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    nav { display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
    nav a {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--dim);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    nav a:hover, nav a.active { color: var(--white); }
    .cta-btn { cursor: pointer; }
    .cta-btn:hover { color: var(--black); opacity: 0.85; }

    /* ── MAIN ───────────────────────────────── */
    main {
      padding: 120px 52px 80px;
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 36px; height: 1px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
      font-weight: 200;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ── PLAN GRID ──────────────────────────── */
    .plans-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .plan-card {
      background: #141414;
      padding: 40px 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }

    .plan-card.featured {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }

    .plan-popular {
      position: absolute;
      top: -1px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .plan-name {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .plan-price {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 200;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .plan-price-sub {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .plan-seats {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .plan-best {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.44);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .plan-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .plan-features {
      list-style: none;
      flex: 1;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .plan-features li {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      padding: 7px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .plan-features li::before {
      content: '·';
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.50);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .plan-features li.inherit {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.44);
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .plan-features li.inherit::before { content: '↳'; font-size: 10px; }

    .plan-cta {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 13px;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      color: var(--white);
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .plan-cta:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    }

    .plan-card.featured .plan-cta {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border-color: var(--white);
    }
    .plan-card.featured .plan-cta:hover { opacity: 0.87; }

    .plan-hint {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* ── PAYMENT NOTE ──────────────────────── */
    .payment-note {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 18px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .payment-note-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.20);
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .payment-note-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .payment-note-text strong {
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* ── PRIVACY SECTION ────────────────────── */
    .privacy-section {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 28px 32px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .privacy-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .privacy-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px 40px;
    }

    .privacy-item {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .privacy-item::before {
      content: '·';
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.40);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-section { margin-bottom: 60px; }

    .faq-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 20px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 300;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--white);
      user-select: none;
    }

    summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

    summary::after {
      content: '+';
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    details[open] summary::after {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    details p {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    details a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

    /* ── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────── */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 20px 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    footer span {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--dimmer);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    footer a {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--dimmer);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--white); }

    /* ── MOBILE ─────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
      .plans-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .privacy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      header { padding: 14px 16px; }
      nav { gap: 16px; }

      main { padding: 88px 24px 60px; }

      h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 9vw, 40px); }

      .plans-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .payment-note { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }

      .privacy-section { padding: 20px; }

      footer { padding: 16px 24px; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <a href="/"><img src="/W+L.png" alt="Grassion" style="height:28px;" onerror="this.style.display='none'" /></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="active">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
    <h1>Start free.<br />Scale with your team.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Free forever for small teams. Pro at $10 per active developer per month (₹599 in India).<br />
      14-day trial on Pro · no credit card required · cancel anytime.
    </p>

    <!-- PLAN CARDS -->
    <div class="plans-grid">

      <!-- Free -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Free</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$0</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">forever</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">Up to 10 active developers</div>
        <div class="plan-best">1 repo · always free</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>AI-PR detection via label, git trailer &amp; body regex</li>
          <li>Weekly ROI verdict: Net Positive / Neutral / Negative</li>
          <li>Codebase health score</li>
          <li>Weekly email digest</li>
          <li>Dark Code Report — monthly refresh, top 3 fragile areas</li>
          <li>GitHub App · 5-minute setup</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href={`${APP_URL}/login`}>Get Started Free</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">No credit card · no time limit</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pro (featured) -->
      <div class="plan-card featured">
        <div class="plan-popular">Most Popular</div>
        <div class="plan-name">Pro</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$10</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">per active dev / month<br />₹599 in India · min 5 seats</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">All repos · unlimited devs</div>
        <div class="plan-best">14-day trial included</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="inherit">Everything in Free</li>
          <li>All repos monitored, no limit</li>
          <li>Daily Dark Code Report — full fragile-and-dark list</li>
          <li>PR coverage check + reviewer routing + understanding buttons</li>
          <li>Slack /grassion who &lt;path&gt;</li>
          <li>MCP server for AI coding agents</li>
          <li>Monday coverage email digest</li>
          <li>Offboarding view — areas losing their last person</li>
          <li>Failure confirmation</li>
          <li>Problem PR alerts with AI root-cause summaries</li>
          <li>Seat waste analysis + tool comparison (Copilot / Cursor / Claude Code)</li>
          <li>Outcomes tracking: reverts, hotfixes, review cycles</li>
          <li>Slack weekly digest + instant alerts</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href={`${APP_URL}/login`}>Start Free Trial</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">14-day trial · no card required</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Business -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Business</div>
        <div class="plan-price" style="font-size:22px; padding-top:6px;">$1,500</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">flat / month + Pro seats</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">Everything in Pro</div>
        <div class="plan-best">Compliance + security tier</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="inherit">Everything in Pro</li>
          <li>Critical-path settings + optional explain-back question</li>
          <li>Compliance evidence export — CSV &amp; PDF per month</li>
          <li>SSO (SAML / OIDC)</li>
          <li>Audit log</li>
          <li>Custom data retention policy</li>
          <li>Security overview dashboard</li>
          <li>24-hour support SLA</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href={`${APP_URL}/login`}>Start Free Trial</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">14-day trial · no card required</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Enterprise -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Enterprise</div>
        <div class="plan-price" style="font-size: 20px; padding-top: 8px;">Contact us</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">custom contract</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">Self-hosted or customer VPC</div>
        <div class="plan-best">India · EU · global</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="inherit">Everything in Business</li>
          <li>Self-hosted or customer-VPC deployment</li>
          <li>Bring-your-own LLM endpoint</li>
          <li>India or EU data hosting</li>
          <li>Custom contract &amp; SLA</li>
          <li>Dedicated account manager</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href="/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">We respond within 24 hours</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- PAYMENT NOTE -->
    <div class="payment-note">
      <div class="payment-note-icon">PAY</div>
      <p class="payment-note-text">
        <strong>USD pricing for global teams. ₹599/dev/mo for India-billed accounts.</strong>
        Charged via Razorpay. Supports credit/debit cards, UPI, and netbanking.
        Clicking "Start Free Trial" takes you to the dashboard — choose your plan there to go directly to checkout.
        Features activate instantly after payment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PRIVACY CONTROLS -->
    <div class="privacy-section">
      <div class="privacy-label">Privacy controls — all plans</div>
      <div class="privacy-grid">
        <div class="privacy-item">Managers see coverage by area and team. Per-person evidence is visible to that person and used for routing only — no per-person ranking or export anywhere.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item"><strong>Team-only mode</strong> (org setting): store only area and team aggregates, no per-person data. Available for EU customers on any plan.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item">Per-developer metrics (seat waste per developer, adoption by member) are admin-only and off by default. Enable in Settings.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item">Data deletion from Settings removes all coverage data within 24 hours — including backups.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="faq-section">
      <div class="faq-label">Billing FAQ</div>

      <details>
        <summary>How does "per active developer" billing work?</summary>
        <p>An "active developer" is a GitHub user who opened or reviewed a pull request in the current billing month. Developers who were inactive that month are not counted. You're billed for the peak active count during the cycle.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What is the minimum seat count for Pro?</summary>
        <p>5 seats minimum. Teams smaller than 5 pay for 5 seats. There is no minimum on the Free plan.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How does INR pricing work?</summary>
        <p>If your Razorpay account is billed in India, the Pro plan is charged at ₹599 per active developer per month instead of $10 USD. The Business flat fee is charged in USD regardless of region. Enterprise pricing is negotiated in the contract.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Which payment methods are supported?</summary>
        <p>Credit/debit cards (domestic and international), UPI, and netbanking via Razorpay. Annual invoicing available on Business and Enterprise plans.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What happens after the free trial?</summary>
        <p>You'll be prompted to choose a plan and add a payment method. No charge is made until you confirm. If you don't subscribe, your account reverts to the Free plan — data is retained.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do you offer refunds?</summary>
        <p>Pro-rated refunds for annual plans. Monthly plans are evaluated case-by-case; write to <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I upgrade or downgrade anytime?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Plan changes take effect at the next billing cycle. Upgrades can be applied immediately on request.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What is the compliance evidence export on Business?</summary>
        <p>A monthly PDF and CSV showing, for each change: the file path, the author's understanding answer (from the PR check-run buttons), the covering reviewer, and the evidence events used for routing. Source code and diffs are never included.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 Grassion Intelligence</span>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:24px;">
      <a href="/security/">Security</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
